    "detailed_description": "<strong>[Game Introduction]</strong><br><br>This game is a horror game in which Mina, tired of her parents' daily fights, sets out to find a mysterious pill that makes people happy in order to escape her hellish days.<br><br><strong>[Gameplay Description]</strong><br><br>Players control the protagonist Mina as she explores her home and the surrounding area, tracking down traces of a mysterious pill. Whether someone takes the pill or not is up to the player's choice. This decision significantly impacts the game's ending, allowing players to experience one of three different outcomes. What choice will you make?<br><br><strong>[Game Features]</strong><br><br>* Exploration and Discovery<br>* Multiple Endings Based on Choices",
